Entity Care allowance application {
    Actions: start application, submit information, determine minor status, verify medical certificate, check national insurance membership, open case, assess developmental disability, assess life threatening continuous supervision and care, assess_illness_or_disability, assess continuous supervision, determine_caregiver_absence_from_work_requirement, assess second caregiver justification, request similar cases, request relevant laws, find similar cases, find relevant laws, review similar cases, review relevant laws, reject application, grant care allowance, summarize case, issue_assessment_and_justification, view justification
    Data properties: child_age: int, medical_certificate: string, number_of_caregivers: int, child_is_minor: boolean, certificate_is_genuine: boolean, child_has_national_insurance_membership: boolean, has_developmental_disability: boolean, needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care: boolean, has_illness_or_disability: boolean, needs_continuous_supervision: boolean, care_requires_absence_from_work: boolean, second_caregiver_is_justified: boolean, assessment: string, justification: string
    States: submitted, prechecked, granted, rejected
}

Role Citizen.

Role Caseworker.

Role System robot.

Role Verification system.

Action start application { Initiators: Citizen, Initially available: true }

Action submit information { Initiators: Citizen, Observers: System robot, Input: child_age: int, medical_certificate: string, number_of_caregivers: int }

Action determine minor status { Initiators: System robot, Observers: Caseworker, Output: child_is_minor: boolean }

Action verify medical certificate { Initiators: System robot, Observers: Verification system, Caseworker, Output: certificate_is_genuine: boolean }

Action check national insurance membership { Initiators: System robot, Observers: Caseworker, Output: child_has_national_insurance_membership: boolean }

Action open case { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action assess developmental disability { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: has_developmental_disability: boolean }

Action assess life threatening continuous supervision and care { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care: boolean }

Action assess_illness_or_disability { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: has_illness_or_disability: boolean }

Action assess continuous supervision { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: needs_continuous_supervision: boolean }

Action determine_caregiver_absence_from_work_requirement { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: care_requires_absence_from_work: boolean }

Action assess second caregiver justification { Initiators: Caseworker, Input: second_caregiver_is_justified: boolean }

Action request similar cases { Initiators: Caseworker, Observers: System robot }

Action request relevant laws { Initiators: Caseworker, Observers: System robot }

Action find similar cases { Initiators: System robot, Observers: Caseworker }

Action find relevant laws { Initiators: System robot, Observers: Caseworker }

Action review similar cases { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action review relevant laws { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action reject application { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action grant care allowance { Initiators: Caseworker }

Action summarize case { Initiators: System robot, Observers: Caseworker }

Action issue_assessment_and_justification { Initiators: Caseworker, Observers: Citizen, Input: assessment: string, justification: string }

Action view justification { Initiators: Citizen }

Declarative specification Care allowance application is submitted means { start application was executed AND submit information was executed AND its child_age is not undefined AND its medical_certificate is not undefined AND its number_of_caregivers is not undefined }

Declarative specification Care allowance application is prechecked means { it is submitted AND determine minor status was executed AND verify medical certificate was executed AND check national insurance membership was executed AND its child_is_minor is not undefined AND its certificate_is_genuine is not undefined AND its child_has_national_insurance_membership is not undefined }

Declarative specification Care allowance application is granted means { it is prechecked AND grant care allowance was executed AND reject application was not executed AND its certificate_is_genuine equal to true AND its child_has_national_insurance_membership equal to true AND its care_requires_absence_from_work equal to true }

Declarative specification Care allowance application is rejected means { it is prechecked AND reject application was executed AND grant care allowance was not executed }

Action submit information is enabled means { start application was executed or is not available }

Action determine minor status is enabled means { submit information was executed or is not available }

Action verify medical certificate is enabled means { submit information was executed or is not available }

Action check national insurance membership is enabled means { submit information was executed or is not available }

Action open case is enabled means { determine minor status was executed or is not available AND verify medical certificate was executed or is not available AND check national insurance membership was executed or is not available }

Action assess developmental disability is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available AND review similar cases is not pending or is not available AND review relevant laws is not pending or is not available }

Action assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available AND review similar cases is not pending or is not available AND review relevant laws is not pending or is not available }

Action assess_illness_or_disability is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available AND review similar cases is not pending or is not available AND review relevant laws is not pending or is not available }

Action assess continuous supervision is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available AND review similar cases is not pending or is not available AND review relevant laws is not pending or is not available }

Action determine_caregiver_absence_from_work_requirement is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available AND review similar cases is not pending or is not available AND review relevant laws is not pending or is not available }

Action assess second caregiver justification is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available AND review similar cases is not pending or is not available AND review relevant laws is not pending or is not available }

Action request similar cases is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available }

Action request relevant laws is enabled means { open case was executed or is not available }

Action find similar cases is enabled means { request similar cases was executed or is not available }

Action find relevant laws is enabled means { request relevant laws was executed or is not available }

Action review similar cases is enabled means { find similar cases was executed or is not available }

Action review relevant laws is enabled means { find relevant laws was executed or is not available }

Scenario: Start application enables submission
Given
  start application is available
  AND start application was not executed
When start application is executed
Then
  start application is not available
  AND submit information is available
  AND submit information is pending.

Scenario: Submit information initiates robot prechecks
Given
  start application was executed
  AND submit information is available
  AND submit information was not executed
When submit information is executed with inputs child_age, medical_certificate, number_of_caregivers
Then
  the Care allowance application's child_age is set to child_age
  AND the Care allowance application's medical_certificate is set to medical_certificate
  AND the Care allowance application's number_of_caregivers is set to number_of_caregivers
  AND submit information is not available
  AND determine minor status is available
  AND determine minor status is pending
  AND verify medical certificate is available
  AND verify medical certificate is pending
  AND check national insurance membership is available
  AND check national insurance membership is pending.

Scenario: Determine minor status records robot finding
Given
  submit information was executed
  AND determine minor status is available
  AND determine minor status was not executed
When determine minor status is executed with outputs child_is_minor
Then
  the Care allowance application's child_is_minor is set to child_is_minor
  AND determine minor status is not available.

Scenario: Verify medical certificate records robot finding
Given
  submit information was executed
  AND verify medical certificate is available
  AND verify medical certificate was not executed
When verify medical certificate is executed with outputs certificate_is_genuine
Then
  the Care allowance application's certificate_is_genuine is set to certificate_is_genuine
  AND verify medical certificate is not available.

Scenario: Check national insurance membership records robot finding
Given
  submit information was executed
  AND check national insurance membership is available
  AND check national insurance membership was not executed
When check national insurance membership is executed with outputs child_has_national_insurance_membership
Then
  the Care allowance application's child_has_national_insurance_membership is set to child_has_national_insurance_membership
  AND check national insurance membership is not available.

Scenario: Minor status completes successful prechecks
Given
  determine minor status is available
  AND determine minor status was not executed
  AND verify medical certificate was executed
  AND check national insurance membership was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's certificate_is_genuine equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's child_has_national_insurance_membership equal to true
When determine minor status is executed with outputs child_is_minor
Then
  open case is available
  AND open case is pending.

Scenario: Certificate verification completes successful prechecks
Given
  verify medical certificate is available
  AND verify medical certificate was not executed
  AND determine minor status was executed
  AND check national insurance membership was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_has_national_insurance_membership equal to true
When verify medical certificate is executed with outputs certificate_is_genuine = true
Then
  open case is available
  AND open case is pending.

Scenario: Membership check completes successful prechecks
Given
  check national insurance membership is available
  AND check national insurance membership was not executed
  AND determine minor status was executed
  AND verify medical certificate was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's certificate_is_genuine equal to true
When check national insurance membership is executed with outputs child_has_national_insurance_membership = true
Then
  open case is available
  AND open case is pending.

Scenario: Fake certificate requires rejection
Given
  verify medical certificate is available
  AND verify medical certificate was not executed
When verify medical certificate is executed with outputs certificate_is_genuine = false
Then
  reject application is available
  AND reject application is pending
  AND grant care allowance is not available
  AND open case is not available.

Scenario: Missing insurance membership requires rejection
Given
  check national insurance membership is available
  AND check national insurance membership was not executed
When check national insurance membership is executed with outputs child_has_national_insurance_membership = false
Then
  reject application is available
  AND reject application is pending
  AND grant care allowance is not available
  AND open case is not available.

Scenario: Open case begins manual assessment stage
Given
  the Care allowance application is prechecked
  AND the Care allowance application's certificate_is_genuine equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's child_has_national_insurance_membership equal to true
  AND open case is available
  AND open case was not executed
When open case is executed
Then
  open case is not available
  AND determine_caregiver_absence_from_work_requirement is available
  AND determine_caregiver_absence_from_work_requirement is pending
  AND request similar cases is available
  AND request relevant laws is available.

Scenario: Open adult case requires adult assessments
Given
  the Care allowance application is prechecked
  AND the Care allowance application's certificate_is_genuine equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's child_has_national_insurance_membership equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to false
  AND open case is available
  AND open case was not executed
When open case is executed
Then
  assess developmental disability is available
  AND assess developmental disability is pending
  AND assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is available
  AND assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is pending.

Scenario: Open minor case requires minor assessments
Given
  the Care allowance application is prechecked
  AND the Care allowance application's certificate_is_genuine equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's child_has_national_insurance_membership equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to true
  AND open case is available
  AND open case was not executed
When open case is executed
Then
  assess_illness_or_disability is available
  AND assess_illness_or_disability is pending
  AND assess continuous supervision is available
  AND assess continuous supervision is pending.

Scenario: Open case with multiple caregivers requires justification assessment
Given
  the Care allowance application is prechecked
  AND the Care allowance application's certificate_is_genuine equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's child_has_national_insurance_membership equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's number_of_caregivers larger than 1
  AND open case is available
  AND open case was not executed
When open case is executed
Then
  assess second caregiver justification is available
  AND assess second caregiver justification is pending.

Scenario: Adult developmental disability assessment records finding
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to false
  AND assess developmental disability is available
  AND assess developmental disability was not executed
When assess developmental disability is executed with inputs has_developmental_disability
Then
  the Care allowance application's has_developmental_disability is set to has_developmental_disability
  AND assess developmental disability is not available.

Scenario: Adult life threatening supervision and care assessment records finding
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to false
  AND assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is available
  AND assess life threatening continuous supervision and care was not executed
When assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is executed with inputs needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care
Then
  the Care allowance application's needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care is set to needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care
  AND assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is not available.

Scenario: Minor illness or disability assessment records finding
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to true
  AND assess_illness_or_disability is available
  AND assess_illness_or_disability was not executed
When assess_illness_or_disability is executed with inputs has_illness_or_disability
Then
  the Care allowance application's has_illness_or_disability is set to has_illness_or_disability
  AND assess_illness_or_disability is not available.

Scenario: Minor continuous supervision assessment records finding
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to true
  AND assess continuous supervision is available
  AND assess continuous supervision was not executed
When assess continuous supervision is executed with inputs needs_continuous_supervision
Then
  the Care allowance application's needs_continuous_supervision is set to needs_continuous_supervision
  AND assess continuous supervision is not available.

Scenario: Adult developmental disability failure requires rejection
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to false
  AND assess developmental disability is available
  AND assess developmental disability was not executed
When assess developmental disability is executed with inputs has_developmental_disability = false
Then
  reject application is available
  AND reject application is pending
  AND grant care allowance is not available.

Scenario: Adult life threatening supervision and care failure requires rejection
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to false
  AND assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is available
  AND assess life threatening continuous supervision and care was not executed
When assess life threatening continuous supervision and care is executed with inputs needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care = false
Then
  reject application is available
  AND reject application is pending
  AND grant care allowance is not available.

Scenario: Minor illness or disability failure requires rejection
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to true
  AND assess_illness_or_disability is available
  AND assess_illness_or_disability was not executed
When assess_illness_or_disability is executed with inputs has_illness_or_disability = false
Then
  reject application is available
  AND reject application is pending
  AND grant care allowance is not available.

Scenario: Minor continuous supervision failure requires rejection
Given
  open case was executed
  AND the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to true
  AND assess continuous supervision is available
  AND assess continuous supervision was not executed
When assess continuous supervision is executed with inputs needs_continuous_supervision = false
Then
  reject application is available
  AND reject application is pending
  AND grant care allowance is not available.

Scenario: Reject application completes rejection decision
Given
  reject application is available
  AND reject application was not executed
  AND grant care allowance was not executed
When reject application is executed
Then
  reject application is not available
  AND grant care allowance is not available.

Scenario: Grant minor case with one caregiver
Given
  the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's has_illness_or_disability equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's needs_continuous_supervision equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's care_requires_absence_from_work equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's number_of_caregivers equal to 1
When grant care allowance is executed
Then
  grant care allowance is not available
  AND reject application is not available
  AND summarize case is available
  AND summarize case is pending.

Scenario: Grant minor case with multiple caregivers
Given
  the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's has_illness_or_disability equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's needs_continuous_supervision equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's care_requires_absence_from_work equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's number_of_caregivers larger than 1
  AND the Care allowance application's second_caregiver_is_justified equal to true
When grant care allowance is executed
Then
  grant care allowance is not available
  AND reject application is not available
  AND summarize case is available
  AND summarize case is pending.

Scenario: Grant adult case with one caregiver
Given
  the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to false
  AND the Care allowance application's has_developmental_disability equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's care_requires_absence_from_work equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's number_of_caregivers equal to 1
When grant care allowance is executed
Then
  grant care allowance is not available
  AND reject application is not available
  AND summarize case is available
  AND summarize case is pending.

Scenario: Grant adult case with multiple caregivers
Given
  the Care allowance application's child_is_minor equal to false
  AND the Care allowance application's has_developmental_disability equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's needs_life_threatening_continuous_supervision_and_care equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's care_requires_absence_from_work equal to true
  AND the Care allowance application's number_of_caregivers larger than 1
  AND the Care allowance application's second_caregiver_is_justified equal to true
When grant care allowance is executed
Then
  grant care allowance is not available
  AND reject application is not available
  AND summarize case is available
  AND summarize case is pending.

Scenario: Case summarization requires assessment and justification
Given
  grant care allowance was executed
When summarize case is executed
Then
  summarize case is not available
  AND issue_assessment_and_justification is available
  AND issue_assessment_and_justification is pending.

Scenario: Issue assessment and justification enables citizen viewing
Given
  summarize case was executed
When issue_assessment_and_justification is executed with inputs assessment, justification
Then
  the Care allowance application's assessment is set to assessment
  AND the Care allowance application's justification is set to justification
  AND issue_assessment_and_justification is not available
  AND view justification is available.

Scenario: Citizen views issued justification
Given
  issue_assessment_and_justification was executed
When view justification is executed
Then
  view justification is available.
